[136.893533, "o", "================================================================================\r\nFINAL FORMULA CHECK\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\nRow 2 (Julien Comte):\r\n  TotalKg (G2): =ROUND(D2+E2+F2,3)\r\n  Dots (H2): =ROUND(IF(B2=\"M\",500/((-307.75076)+(24.0900756)*C2+(-0.1918759221)*C2^2+(0.0007391293)*C2^3+(-0.000001093)*C2^4)*G2,500/((-57.96288)+(13.6175032)*C2+(-0.1126655495)*C2^2+(0.0005158568)*C2^3+(-0.000001...\r\n\r\n\r\nRow 10 (Amber Gomez - Female):\r\n  TotalKg (G10): =ROUND(D10+E10+F10,3)\r\n  Dots (H10): =ROUND(IF(B10=\"M\",500/((-307.75076)+(24.0900756)*C10+(-0.1918759221)*C10^2+(0.0007391293)*C10^3+(-0.000001093)*C10^4)*G10,500/((-57.96288)+(13.6175032)*C10+(-0.1126655495)*C10^2+(0.0005158568)*C10^3+(...\r\n\r\n\r\nRow 21 (Curtis Laird - Last row):\r\n  TotalKg (G21): =ROUND(D21+E21+F21,3)\r\n  Dots (H21): =ROUND(IF(B21=\"M\",500/((-307.75076)+(24.0900756)*C21+(-0.1918759221)*C21^2+(0.0007391293)*C21^3+(-0.000001093)*C21^4)*G21,500/((-57.96288)+(13.6175032)*C21+(-0.1126655495)*C21^2+(0.0005158568)*C21^3+(...\r\n\r\n"]
[136.893617, "o", "================================================================================\r\nTASK COMPLETION SUMMARY\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n✓ Step 1: Copied required columns to Dots sheet\r\n  - Name, Sex, BodyweightKg, Best3SquatKg, Best3BenchKg, Best3DeadliftKg\r\n  - Column order and names preserved from Data sheet\r\n  - 20 lifters copied\r\n\r\n✓ Step 2: Added TotalKg column with Excel formulas\r\n  - Formula: =ROUND(D[row]+E[row]+F[row],3)\r\n  - Calculates sum of Squat + Bench + Deadlift\r\n  - Rounded to 3 decimal places\r\n\r\n✓ Step 3: Added Dots column with Excel formulas\r\n  - Formula uses IF(B[row]=\"M\",...) to distinguish Men vs Women\r\n  - Men's coefficients: A=-307.75076, B=24.0900756, C=-0.1918759221,\r\n    D=0.0007391293, E=-0.000001093\r\n  - Women's coefficients: A=-57.96288, B=13.6175032, C=-0.1126655495,\r\n    D=0.0005158568, E=-0.0000010706\r\n  - Formula: 500/(A+B*BW+C*BW²+D*BW³+E*BW⁴)*TotalKg\r\n  - Rounded to 3 decimal places\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\nALL TASKS COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY!\r\n================================================================================\r\n"]
